  <section>
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>The Great Atlantic Puffin Company operates two cannabis dispensary locations in western Maine under a single brand identity. The medical dispensary sits in Fryeburg on Bridgton Road, just minutes from the New Hampshire border. The adult-use (recreational) dispensary operates in Bridgton on Portland Road. Both share the same phone number and management.</p>
    <p>The operator markets itself as a craft-focused, accessible dispensary serving both Maine medical patients and New Hampshire adults crossing the border for legal cannabis. NH has not legalized recreational cannabis, making Puffin Co.'s Bridgton location a meaningful draw for southern NH customers in Conway, North Conway, and the Mount Washington Valley.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Two Locations, One Operator</h2>
    <p><strong>Medical (Fryeburg):</strong> 235 Bridgton Road, Fryeburg, ME 04037. This is the original storefront. Maine MMMP card required. Open to medical patients across western Maine and southern New Hampshire.</p>
    <p><strong>Adult-Use (Bridgton):</strong> 510 Portland Road, Bridgton, ME 04009. Adult-use / recreational cannabis for customers 21+ with valid ID. Medical cardholders receive a 20% discount at the rec location.</p>
    <p>Both stores carry the same general product categories: flower (sativa, indica, hybrid), THC cartridges, concentrates, edibles, and CBD products including flower, tinctures, and topicals. Inventory rotates daily.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Pricing and Discounts</h2>
    <p>Puffin Co. publicly advertises several ongoing specials on its medical site:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>$15 on select 1g distillate cartridges</li>
      <li>2g of select concentrate for $20</li>
      <li>$15 and $20 select eighths</li>
      <li>$100/oz weekly deals on select flower</li>
      <li>$80/oz smalls (while supplies last)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Military members and first-time customers qualify for additional discounts. The operator also runs in-store deals that change daily. Confirm current pricing by phone or via the online menu before visiting.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Online Ordering and Delivery</h2>
    <p>Puffin Co. lists on Weedmaps for online pre-order and in-store pickup at both locations. Browse the menu at <a href="https://weedmaps.com/dispensaries/the-great-atlantic-puffin-company">weedmaps.com/dispensaries/the-great-atlantic-puffin-company</a>.</p>
    <p>Delivery availability is governed by Maine's courier license rules. Maine allows medical delivery by registered caregivers and licensed couriers; adult-use delivery is more restricted. Confirm with the operator before relying on delivery for either location.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Service Area</h2>
    <p>Puffin Co. primarily serves the western Maine and southern New Hampshire border region:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Fryeburg</strong> (in town) — 5 min</li>
      <li><strong>Conway / North Conway, NH</strong> — 20-25 min south (key NH draw)</li>
      <li><strong>Bridgton</strong> (in town) — 5-10 min</li>
