      <li><strong>Cornish / Hiram</strong> — 15-20 min</li>
      <li><strong>Brownfield / Denmark</strong> — 10-15 min</li>
      <li><strong>Bethel / Newry</strong> — 30-40 min north</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The Fryeburg location's proximity to the New Hampshire border is the operator's key differentiator. NH has not legalized adult-use cannabis, so the Bridgton rec location captures significant cross-border traffic. Per the operator's own site, the dispensary is "located just minutes from the New Hampshire border" and serves customers from both states.</p>
  </section>

